'''Shining Amaterasu''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]] and can be unlocked by rolling the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]] increases her attack power. [[Talents]] were also added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]]. Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

